WEBVTT

00:00.950 --> 00:02.870
<b><i>Migi. The time has come.</i></b>

00:03.250 --> 00:06.960
<b>Finally, we will
search through the Ichijo house.</b>

00:07.040 --> 00:08.090
<b>Listen, Migi.</b>

00:08.170 --> 00:10.840
<b>You buy us time
by spending some with them.</b>

00:11.260 --> 00:14.340
<b>Meanwhile, I'll check
all wallpapers in their home.</b>

00:14.930 --> 00:17.970
<b>They don't know that there's two of us.</b>

00:18.260 --> 00:19.770
<b>Don't let down your guard, Migi.</b>

00:20.220 --> 00:22.020
<b>I know that, Dali.</b>

00:22.390 --> 00:25.230
<b>Let's proceed as cautiously as always.</b>

00:25.850 --> 00:27.610
<b>Just like always.</b>

00:33.320 --> 00:34.780
<b>Mother.</b>

00:40.240 --> 00:42.000
<b>Hitori Sonoyama.</b>

00:44.370 --> 00:46.710
<b>Something unusual.</b>

02:20.260 --> 02:23.390
<b>We are very grateful to have been invited</b>

02:23.470 --> 02:24.640
<b>to your home tonight.</b>

02:25.220 --> 02:27.520
<b>The pleasure is all ours.</b>

02:27.600 --> 02:30.190
<b>It's an honor to host the amazing Hitori.</b>

02:31.520 --> 02:32.400
<b>Yoo...</b>

02:33.270 --> 02:34.780
<b>...hoo.</b>

02:36.240 --> 02:38.450
<b>Let's make a toast to</b>

02:38.530 --> 02:42.160
<b>Hitori being number one
in the average class midterms.</b>

02:42.660 --> 02:43.990
<b>Cheers.</b>

02:45.540 --> 02:46.790
<b><i>Not here.</i></b>

02:47.120 --> 02:48.120
<b><i>Not here.</i></b>

02:49.370 --> 02:50.620
<b><i>This is wrong.</i></b>

02:54.000 --> 02:56.300
<b><i>Damnit. It's like an ant hill.</i></b>

02:57.090 --> 02:58.340
<b><i>Where are you,</i></b>

02:58.420 --> 02:59.880
<b><i>water flea room?</i></b>

03:00.800 --> 03:03.970
<b>What education are you giving Hitori?</b>

03:04.350 --> 03:05.850
<b>Ah, no.</b>

03:05.930 --> 03:08.350
<b>We haven't done anything.</b>

03:08.430 --> 03:11.100
<b>Mom taught me how to bake a pie.</b>

03:11.190 --> 03:11.850
<b>Oh.</b>

03:12.600 --> 03:14.820
<b><i>Maybe the Ichijos are innocent.</i></b>

03:14.900 --> 03:17.900
<b><i>But something still feels off.</i></b>

03:18.360 --> 03:19.780
<b>Baking a pie?</b>

03:20.110 --> 03:22.950
<b>How wonderful. Maybe I should learn too.</b>

03:23.370 --> 03:25.700
<b>It would be my pleasure.</b>

03:25.780 --> 03:29.370
<b>One could bake
a splendid pie with an oven like yours.</b>

03:29.450 --> 03:31.420
<b>How big could it be?</b>

03:31.540 --> 03:33.880
<b>As big as a Wanyudo, probably.</b>

03:33.960 --> 03:35.420
<b>Oh, Dear.</b>

03:35.500 --> 03:38.050
<b>That's an ancient reference.</b>

03:38.130 --> 03:39.300
<b>Pardon me.</b>

03:39.380 --> 03:41.300
<b>It reeks. It's definitely fishy.</b>

03:41.380 --> 03:43.220
<b>Then maybe as big as a UFO?</b>

03:43.300 --> 03:44.800
<b>A flying saucer!</b>

03:44.890 --> 03:46.310
<b><i>This dinnerparty.</i></b>

03:47.560 --> 03:49.680
<b>It's really seems like</b>

03:49.770 --> 03:52.770
<b>the Sonoyama family is truly joyful.</b>

03:53.100 --> 03:56.190
<b>You're far too kind.</b>

03:56.270 --> 03:58.320
<b>All I can do is bake cherry pies.</b>

04:00.440 --> 04:03.280
<b>Of course that's the kind of setting</b>

04:03.660 --> 04:04.910
<b>where Hitori would</b>

04:04.990 --> 04:07.490
<b>engage in misconduct.</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:14.790
<b>Eiji.</b>

04:15.290 --> 04:16.590
<b>Yes, Mom.</b>

04:19.710 --> 04:20.920
<b>Hitori.</b>

04:23.050 --> 04:25.220
<b>Do you recognize this?</b>

04:30.020 --> 04:33.310
<b><i>Mother's keepsake.</i></b>

04:35.730 --> 04:37.190
<b>Hold up your hands.</b>

04:37.440 --> 04:38.320
<b>Huh?</b>

04:40.150 --> 04:41.490
<b><i>Migi, don't.</i></b>

04:43.280 --> 04:45.780
<b>Why did you check your neck?</b>

04:46.450 --> 04:48.660
<b>That's... I...</b>

04:48.740 --> 04:51.700
<b>You are wearing it right now, are you not?</b>

04:52.500 --> 04:54.920
<b>The button that you stole.</b>

04:56.500 --> 04:58.590
<b>W- Wait a minute.</b>

04:58.670 --> 05:00.880
<b>Hitori would never steal anything.</b>

05:01.260 --> 05:04.090
<b>Why would he snatch the buttons</b>

05:04.170 --> 05:06.010
<b>of his friend's jammies?</b>

05:06.300 --> 05:08.300
<b>I would like to know too.</b>

05:08.390 --> 05:10.720
<b>I would like to clear things up,</b>

05:10.810 --> 05:12.180
<b>because I trust him.</b>

05:12.850 --> 05:13.770
<b>Oh.</b>

05:14.020 --> 05:16.310
<b>Take off your clothes, Hitori.</b>

05:24.900 --> 05:26.200
<b>Hitori.</b>

05:28.990 --> 05:29.950
<b><i>Dali!</i></b>

05:33.120 --> 05:35.120
<b>That's so mean, Eiji.</b>

05:35.210 --> 05:37.290
<b>Are you suspecting your friend?</b>

05:37.880 --> 05:39.790
<b>I just told you.</b>

05:39.880 --> 05:41.750
<b>I want to trust you.</b>

05:42.550 --> 05:44.460
<b>Yet you want me to strip?</b>

05:44.760 --> 05:45.800
<b>Yes.</b>

05:46.970 --> 05:48.090
<b>But...</b>

05:48.720 --> 05:49.850
<b>What is it?</b>

05:51.810 --> 05:53.100
<b>Uhm,</b>

05:53.180 --> 05:55.480
<b>how do I put it,</b>

05:55.560 --> 05:56.690
<b>you know?</b>

05:58.850 --> 06:01.570
<b><i>Well done, keep going, Migi.</i></b>

06:01.900 --> 06:04.480
<b><i>Taking my clothes off</i>
<i>in front of everyone is</i></b>

06:04.570 --> 06:06.570
<b>is a little embarrassing.</b>

06:10.910 --> 06:13.490
<b>Quit messing around.</b>

06:16.750 --> 06:18.580
<b><i>Come on.</i></b>

06:20.250 --> 06:21.420
<b>-Take it off.
-Wait!</b>

06:32.600 --> 06:35.220
<b>See? I didn't take it.</b>

06:35.470 --> 06:36.680
<b>And the pockets?</b>

06:36.810 --> 06:37.600
<b>You can check.</b>

06:37.810 --> 06:40.350
<b>Do you want to check inside my undies?</b>

06:42.060 --> 06:42.900
<b>Oh.</b>

06:46.030 --> 06:47.320
<b>Hitori.</b>

06:47.400 --> 06:49.820
<b>I think it's time to go home.</b>

06:52.700 --> 06:56.450
<b>Eiji, maybe check
inside your washing machine.</b>

06:58.540 --> 06:59.500
<b>Oh.</b>

07:08.300 --> 07:09.300
<b>Fidélité.</b>

07:11.430 --> 07:12.300
<b>Do you got it?</b>

07:13.180 --> 07:17.220
<b>Search for something
with this same smell.</b>

07:19.640 --> 07:21.850
<b><i>I cannot believe they keep a beast.</i></b>

07:22.150 --> 07:25.150
<b><i>I need to throw the button far away,</i></b>

07:25.400 --> 07:28.860
<b><i>then flee when they are not looking.</i></b>

07:35.370 --> 07:38.120
<b>Fidélité, did you find it?</b>

07:38.200 --> 07:39.290
<b><i>Oh no.</i></b>

07:39.370 --> 07:41.580
<b><i>If they look under the table right now,</i></b>

07:43.210 --> 07:45.210
<b><i>they'll find out that</i></b>

07:47.420 --> 07:49.130
<b><i>there's two of us.</i></b>

07:55.180 --> 07:56.560
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

07:56.640 --> 07:57.890
<b>I took it!</b>

08:03.810 --> 08:04.940
<b><i>Migi?</i></b>

08:05.400 --> 08:08.820
<b>Hitori, you would never do that...</b>

08:08.900 --> 08:10.110
<b>Never.</b>

08:10.190 --> 08:13.200
<b>When did you manage to take it?</b>

08:13.280 --> 08:16.280
<b>He was with us the whole time.</b>

08:16.370 --> 08:18.700
<b>When I went to the restroom,</b>

08:18.790 --> 08:20.620
<b>the pajama was in there.</b>

08:20.700 --> 08:21.710
<b><i>Migi?</i></b>

08:24.250 --> 08:28.130
<b>I just thought the button was so gorgeous.</b>

08:31.170 --> 08:34.260
<b>Hitori's mother and father,</b>

08:34.800 --> 08:37.600
<b>what do you teach your child?</b>

08:38.350 --> 08:40.390
<b>He's just a child.</b>

08:40.470 --> 08:43.600
<b>He meant no harm. Please forgive him.</b>

08:44.350 --> 08:48.400
<b>What would happen if
the orphanage were to find out about this?</b>

08:48.900 --> 08:50.400
<b>Maybe</b>

08:50.480 --> 08:54.320
<b>you would never see Hitori ever again.</b>

08:55.570 --> 08:58.740
<b>Let me make a suggestion.</b>

08:58.830 --> 09:01.500
<b>Until Hitori has been
steered back onto the right path,</b>

09:01.580 --> 09:05.000
<b>let us take care of him in this house.</b>

09:38.990 --> 09:40.330
<b>Hitori.</b>

09:40.410 --> 09:41.950
<b>It's dinnertime.</b>

09:50.590 --> 09:52.460
<b>I'm not an animal.</b>

09:52.880 --> 09:55.550
<b>Just spit it out already.</b>

09:57.180 --> 09:59.930
<b>Why do you have the button</b>

10:00.010 --> 10:01.760
<b>that I lost eight years ago?</b>

10:01.850 --> 10:03.600
<b>I told you already.</b>

10:03.970 --> 10:06.350
<b>I found it on the bathroom floor.</b>

10:06.440 --> 10:07.770
<b>Do not lie.</b>

10:07.980 --> 10:10.770
<b>I've been looking for this forever.</b>

10:11.110 --> 10:13.110
<b>I searched all over the house.</b>

10:13.400 --> 10:14.650
<b>No way it was just lying around.</b>

10:16.700 --> 10:18.860
<b>What are you hiding?</b>

10:20.320 --> 10:21.580
<b>That's...</b>

10:27.000 --> 10:28.290
<b>Fine.</b>

10:28.920 --> 10:31.790
<b>Your mind is twisted.</b>

10:33.210 --> 10:37.260
<b>Seems like you need to be
re-educated from scratch.</b>

10:40.260 --> 10:42.600
<b><i>Migi is on the other side of that door.</i></b>

10:43.060 --> 10:45.430
<b><i>Hang on. I'll rescue you.</i></b>

10:47.940 --> 10:49.100
<b><i>It won't work.</i></b>

10:49.190 --> 10:51.690
<b><i>That beast is well-trained.</i></b>

10:51.940 --> 10:53.270
<b><i>If it has come to this</i></b>

10:57.820 --> 11:00.280
<b><i>I will move it by force.</i></b>

11:08.160 --> 11:08.910
<b><i>Now.</i></b>

11:18.840 --> 11:19.970
<b><i>It's going to bite me.</i></b>

11:35.070 --> 11:36.570
<b>Wait, you...</b>

11:37.320 --> 11:40.280
<b>just wanted someone to play with?</b>

11:43.660 --> 11:46.620
<b>Once I've saved Migi,
I'll come play with you.</b>

12:05.470 --> 12:06.850
<b>Mom.</b>

12:06.930 --> 12:08.470
<b>Come here.</b>

12:13.560 --> 12:16.900
<b>Can you hear the water fleas singing?</b>

12:25.780 --> 12:26.620
<b>Migi.</b>

12:26.910 --> 12:27.740
<b>Migi.</b>

12:29.830 --> 12:31.790
<b>The song of the water fleas...</b>

12:33.870 --> 12:35.040
<b>Are you in there?</b>

12:37.130 --> 12:37.880
<b>Dali?</b>

12:38.250 --> 12:40.340
<b>Migi! Wait a little,
I'll get it open.</b>

12:40.800 --> 12:43.220
<b>I'm going to stay here, Dali.</b>

12:44.050 --> 12:45.550
<b>Migi? What are you--</b>

12:45.640 --> 12:49.390
<b>They don't know that there's two of us.</b>

12:49.520 --> 12:52.600
<b>As long as I'm in here,
they will lower their guard.</b>

12:52.810 --> 12:56.310
<b>You must use that chance
to search the house.</b>

12:56.810 --> 12:57.980
<b>But, Migi...</b>

12:58.190 --> 12:59.530
<b>Will you be okay?</b>

12:59.610 --> 13:01.110
<b>Are you eating?</b>

13:01.440 --> 13:02.280
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:02.360 --> 13:04.320
<b>They're not hurting you, are they?</b>

13:04.400 --> 13:05.320
<b>No.</b>

13:05.660 --> 13:08.030
<b>Migi. Is that the truth?</b>

13:08.740 --> 13:10.740
<b><i>Stop worrying, Dali.</i></b>

13:12.540 --> 13:13.870
<b><i>There's no way</i></b>

13:13.960 --> 13:16.420
<b><i>I'd let Dali see me like this.</i></b>

13:17.460 --> 13:19.420
<b>I'll be fine.</b>

13:21.340 --> 13:23.880
<b>Can we talk for a second?</b>

13:24.380 --> 13:25.300
<b>Yeah.</b>

13:28.680 --> 13:30.310
<b>I looked everywhere,</b>

13:30.390 --> 13:32.770
<b>but there’s no water fleas anywhere.</b>

13:33.270 --> 13:34.690
<b>Water fleas...</b>

13:35.640 --> 13:37.810
<b>Hey, Dali, do you remember?</b>

13:38.150 --> 13:39.690
<b>We heard the water fleas sing,</b>

13:39.770 --> 13:41.980
<b>under the bed, together with Mother.</b>

13:42.900 --> 13:44.360
<b>The water fleas singing?</b>

13:44.820 --> 13:46.110
<b>Though now I know</b>

13:46.200 --> 13:49.370
<b>it was the sound of
the piano in the next room.</b>

13:50.280 --> 13:51.290
<b>A piano?</b>

13:54.750 --> 13:56.920
<b>STORAGE - PIANO</b>

13:57.000 --> 13:59.960
<b>A hidden room?</b>

14:00.040 --> 14:03.170
<b>Migi, check the wallpaper in that room.</b>

14:03.710 --> 14:04.760
<b>The wallpaper?</b>

14:21.020 --> 14:24.190
<b>This room is where we used to live.</b>

14:31.330 --> 14:34.620
<b>GOAL</b>

14:37.660 --> 14:40.790
<b>WELL DONE, MY DEAR MIGI AND DALI</b>

14:44.670 --> 14:46.880
<b>Mother!</b>

14:51.430 --> 14:53.850
<b>What are you doing, Migi? Be quiet!</b>

14:53.930 --> 14:56.480
<b>Mother!</b>

14:56.560 --> 14:57.890
<b>Migi, you idiot.</b>

15:18.080 --> 15:20.120
<b>You're hungry, aren't you?</b>

15:22.380 --> 15:24.170
<b>It's time for milk.</b>

15:26.630 --> 15:30.680
<b>Grow up and become Eiji.</b>

15:36.810 --> 15:38.890
<b><i>The Ichijos are good at hiding.</i></b>

15:40.270 --> 15:41.560
<b><i>Ever since then,</i></b>

15:41.650 --> 15:44.190
<b><i>I eavesdropped on their conversations.</i></b>

15:45.690 --> 15:47.570
<b><i>And it bordered on eerie that</i></b>

15:47.650 --> 15:51.780
<b><i>not once did they ever mention Migi,</i>
<i>whom they were holding captive.</i></b>

15:52.700 --> 15:54.990
<b><i>What is the deal with that button?</i></b>

15:56.030 --> 15:57.950
<b><i>Was it our mother's dying message?</i></b>

15:59.040 --> 16:00.660
<b><i>Was she saying Eiji did it?</i></b>

16:01.420 --> 16:02.620
<b><i>That's ridiculous.</i></b>

16:02.710 --> 16:04.630
<b><i>A five year old is no murderer.</i></b>

16:05.500 --> 16:07.340
<b><i>So then who is it?</i></b>

16:07.420 --> 16:10.800
<b><i>I can't seem to find the answer.</i></b>

16:11.340 --> 16:15.050
<b><i>Let's start by</i>
<i>scrutinizing the father's study.</i></b>

16:21.690 --> 16:22.520
<b>Huh?</b>

16:22.810 --> 16:24.480
<b>Who could it be?</b>

16:25.060 --> 16:27.190
<b><i>At this time on Wednesdays...</i></b>

16:27.480 --> 16:29.150
<b><i>the house ought to be empty.</i></b>

16:32.530 --> 16:33.360
<b><i>It ought to...</i></b>

16:42.040 --> 16:45.960
<b>It's me, Micchan!</b>

16:46.040 --> 16:47.460
<b>Ms. Micchan...</b>

16:47.540 --> 16:49.210
<b>I heard all about it.</b>

16:49.300 --> 16:52.170
<b>You're staying with the Ichijo family?</b>

16:52.880 --> 16:54.800
<b><i>Yocchan and Papa</i></b>

16:54.890 --> 16:57.140
<b><i>are devastated beyond words.</i></b>

16:58.010 --> 17:00.430
<b>Why are you here?</b>

17:00.680 --> 17:01.640
<b>Oh,</b>

17:01.730 --> 17:03.770
<b>I'm a housekeeper.</b>

17:03.850 --> 17:06.190
<b>Every Wednesday,
I work at the Ichijo house.</b>

17:07.310 --> 17:08.570
<b><i>Right.</i></b>

17:08.650 --> 17:11.190
<b><i>This old lady is</i>
<i>the one who found the wallpaper.</i></b>

17:12.400 --> 17:15.160
<b><i>I have no choice but to use her.</i></b>

17:16.490 --> 17:18.200
<b>Hey, Micchan.</b>

17:18.280 --> 17:19.330
<b>Hm?</b>

17:19.410 --> 17:22.160
<b>Does this house have no secrets?</b>

17:23.830 --> 17:26.790
<b>If you find any,
you better tell me about them.</b>

17:26.880 --> 17:30.090
<b>I better start cleaning.</b>

17:39.260 --> 17:41.350
<b>Ow, you're like an eel!</b>

17:42.100 --> 17:44.350
<b><i>There has to be something here.</i></b>

17:44.890 --> 17:48.190
<b><i>Our mother was held captive here.</i></b>

17:49.900 --> 17:50.900
<b>Hm?</b>

17:56.860 --> 17:59.070
<b><i>-Mot...</i>
-What did you find?</b>

17:59.620 --> 18:02.040
<b>Hey, Micchan.</b>

18:02.120 --> 18:03.000
<b>Hm?</b>

18:03.370 --> 18:05.580
<b>Do you know this woman?</b>

18:05.870 --> 18:08.420
<b>Judging by her clothes,</b>

18:08.500 --> 18:11.090
<b>she was probably
the housekeeper at the time.</b>

18:11.670 --> 18:13.300
<b>It's strange, though.</b>

18:13.670 --> 18:15.340
<b>She looks so young,</b>

18:15.420 --> 18:19.760
<b>but the Ichijos don't want
anyone under the age of 50.</b>

18:30.610 --> 18:32.230
<b>Ah, no, I can't!</b>

18:32.320 --> 18:34.900
<b>I'm not supposed to
clean the second floor.</b>

18:36.860 --> 18:39.160
<b>Oh, Hitori!</b>

18:39.240 --> 18:42.780
<b>Look at all the crumbs here.</b>

18:42.870 --> 18:46.750
<b>No way I can just ignore this,
that really won't do.</b>

18:50.670 --> 18:52.590
<b>Hitori, you search low!</b>

18:52.670 --> 18:55.130
<b>And I'll focus on everything high up!</b>

18:55.210 --> 18:58.340
<b>Everywhere, perfectly,
not missing a single spot!</b>

18:58.720 --> 19:00.720
<b>You seem to be having fun.</b>

19:01.090 --> 19:02.760
<b>Of course I am.</b>

19:03.260 --> 19:04.770
<b>The Ichijos secrets are</b>

19:05.100 --> 19:08.640
<b>what everyone wants to find.</b>

19:08.730 --> 19:12.480
<b>I can't wait to tell someone about it.</b>

19:15.230 --> 19:16.570
<b>Oh.</b>

19:17.490 --> 19:19.150
<b>That's strange.</b>

19:19.450 --> 19:24.120
<b>Usually you'd expect dust to
gather on a pictureframe like this...</b>

19:29.670 --> 19:32.500
<b>No, you painting thief!</b>

19:46.770 --> 19:48.310
<b>Micchan, you’re cheating.</b>

19:48.390 --> 19:50.810
<b>I'm the one who figured it out, you know.</b>

19:55.070 --> 19:55.980
<b>Micchan?</b>

20:02.240 --> 20:04.320
<b>Micchan, is this...?</b>

20:04.410 --> 20:05.330
<b>I think</b>

20:05.410 --> 20:08.790
<b>it's a diorama of Origon Village.</b>

20:10.750 --> 20:14.130
<b>Look, Hitori, it's the Sonoyama house.</b>

20:15.340 --> 20:18.590
<b>Yocchan! And Papa!</b>

20:23.550 --> 20:24.760
<b>Akiyama...</b>

20:26.140 --> 20:27.310
<b>The rodent.</b>

20:27.390 --> 20:28.720
<b>No way.</b>

20:29.310 --> 20:31.940
<b>I don't even live here, but there I am.</b>

20:32.310 --> 20:33.980
<b>In the Ichijo house...</b>

20:36.110 --> 20:38.860
<b>My eyes are way too close together.</b>

20:39.440 --> 20:40.320
<b>Micchan?</b>

20:41.860 --> 20:42.820
<b>Here...</b>

20:43.240 --> 20:45.370
<b>Data about all the villagers.</b>

20:47.700 --> 20:49.790
<b>So the Ichijos...</b>

20:51.210 --> 20:52.710
<b>are surveilling</b>

20:52.790 --> 20:54.580
<b>all of Origon Village?</b>

21:04.090 --> 21:05.010
<b>Someone...</b>

21:05.340 --> 21:06.970
<b>... Is back home?</b>

21:15.980 --> 21:17.310
<b>Hitori, in here.</b>

21:20.860 --> 21:21.740
<b>Okay,</b>

21:21.820 --> 21:24.400
<b>you can't open it until it's all quiet.</b>

21:24.490 --> 21:25.490
<b>What about you?</b>

21:26.450 --> 21:27.950
<b>I'm fine.</b>

21:28.030 --> 21:31.370
<b>You can always
count on me to clean up.</b>

21:31.450 --> 21:32.370
<b>Micchan.</b>

23:19.690 --> 23:20.600
<b>Micchan?</b>
